{"reviewId": "290006178_8049nOZBY", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "深以为然！存钱是没有前途的，因为你一生的财富按照康波周期理论是有定数的，如果会做波段，利用价格波动，就能放大财富，比如在好的时机买房买股票。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "1237-1294", "abstract": "康波的本质表现是价格的波动，而人生的财富积累根本上源于资产价格的投资或投机，人生财富靠康波，康波就是人生的财富规划", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "290006178_8049nOZBY", "userVid": 290006178, "topics": [], "createTime": 1746956643, "userEditTime": 1746956686, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 290006178, "name": "yyds", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-AqDafFhKTQQoe2oNxRSWEeb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "yyds", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "只需真实，不必完美", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202412-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 22, "likes": [{"userVid": 295767405, "name": "UC", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/icLI8TqAuDUTXPjK9IbtnkI9PqicOQxzqo1ghoJicunW2KNYtxnqtCe61mMuBCq58YfbExD8vvMXiavnCSGuicdogoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "不存钱买房买股票怎么有钱，手里的钱越多遇到机会赚的就越多", "reviewId": "290006178_8049nOZBY", "commentId": "290006178_8049nOZBY_c416236402_8623qAumU", "userVid": 416236402, "createTime": 1767967274, "auth